+*   **Parameters:** $N_p$ (Blender: $\le 2$, LLFF: $\le 4$); Tensor ranks $R_\sigma, R_c$ (e.g., $R_\sigma=16, R_c=48$) [S1].
+*   **Performance:** Improves I-time and T-time of original TensoRF with similar quality [S1].
